Constraints
Read-only analysis.
No heavy parsing or normalization pipelines.
Do not expand beyond custom metadata scope.
No deep schema analysis.
Do not produce a full target architecture. Keep this prompt strictly about patterns, anti-patterns, and gaps.
If Inputs Are Missing
If Prompt 1-4 outputs and or metadata folders are not available: - output the same headings - clearly state what is missing - populate Assumptions with the minimal retrieval checks needed to proceed

